            "transcript": "The 2026 World Artificial Intelligence Conference, or WAIC 2026, opened in Shanghai on July 17th under the theme \"Intelligent Connectivity, Infinite Possibilities.\" The event attracted exhibitors from more than 60 countries and quickly became the focal point for discussions on how AI is reshaping everyday life.\n\nThe standout exhibit this year was the Baiyuzhi universal AI platform, which demonstrated breakthroughs across multiple domains. In healthcare, the platform showcased an AI-powered health assistant called HealthPal. HealthPal can analyze a user's voice patterns and facial micro-expressions to provide early warnings of depression and anxiety disorders. Clinical trials have reported an accuracy rate of 89 percent, making it one of the most reliable AI diagnostic tools for mental health.\n\nIn urban transportation, the CityFlow intelligent traffic management system has been piloted in Shanghai and Shenzhen. By integrating real-time data from cameras, sensors, and navigation apps, CityFlow dynamically adjusts traffic signal timings and route guidance. Officials report that peak-hour congestion has been reduced by approximately 23 percent in pilot zones.\n\nThe conference also placed significant emphasis on AI ethics. China released the White Paper on Artificial Intelligence Ethics Governance 2026, which proposes a comprehensive framework covering data privacy, algorithmic transparency, and accountability standards. Over 200 industry leaders signed a joint pledge to adopt the guidelines in their product development.\n\nQuestion 9: What was the main theme of WAIC 2026?\nQuestion 10: According to the passage, what health condition can HealthPal help detect?\nQuestion 11: What was one outcome of the CityFlow system mentioned in the passage?",
            "translation": "2026年世界人工智能大会（简称WAIC 2026）于7月17日在上海开幕，主题为“智能互联，无限可能”。本届大会吸引了来自60多个国家的参展商，并迅速成为讨论人工智能如何重塑日常生活的焦点。\n\n今年的明星展品是Baiyuzhi通用人工智能平台，它在多个领域展示了突破性成果。在医疗健康领域，该平台展示了一款名为HealthPal的人工智能健康助手。HealthPal能够分析用户的语音模式和面部微表情，对抑郁症和焦虑症进行早期预警。临床试验显示其准确率达89%，使其成为最可靠的心理健康人工智能诊断工具之一。\n\n在城市交通领域，CityFlow智能交通管理系统已在上海和深圳开展试点。通过整合来自摄像头、传感器和导航应用的实时数据，CityFlow能够动态调整交通信号配时和路线引导。官方报告称，试点区域的晚高峰拥堵已减少约23%。\n\n大会还高度重视人工智能伦理。中国发布了《人工智能伦理治理白皮书（2026）》，提出了一个涵盖数据隐私、算法透明和问责标准的全面框架。200多位行业领袖签署了联合承诺，将在产品开发中采用这些准则。\n\nQuestion 9: WAIC 2026的主题是什么？\nQuestion 10: 根据短文，HealthPal能够帮助检测什么健康问题？\nQuestion 11: 短文中提到的CityFlow系统的一项成果是什么？"
