            "answer": "C",
            "explanation": "细节理解题。题干问：根据文章，以下哪项最能描述第5天现场直播的意义。根 据第五段“the crew transmitted a 22-minute high-definition broadcast that was viewed by an estimated 520 million people worldwide... The broadcast included a brief conversation between the crew and students from schools in eight countries”，可知C项“有超过5亿人观看，并包括与来自多个国家学生的对话”正确。因此，选C。"
