            "transcript": "M: I'm planning a trip to Italy this summer. I want to visit some of the Winter Olympic venues — Cortina, the sliding center, maybe even try the bobsled track if they offer tourist rides.\nW: They do, actually. The Cortina Sliding Centre is open to the public from May through October with a guided experience. But you'll need to book at least two months in advance — post-Olympic tourism has been booming there since February.\nQuestion: What does the woman tell the man about the Olympic venue?",
