            "transcript": "M: Did you hear about the World Cup ticket lottery results? Over 20 million applications were submitted for the first phase, but only about 2 million tickets were allocated. My cousin in Toronto applied for all three of Canada's group-stage matches and got nothing.\nW: With 48 teams and 104 matches, demand was always going to outstrip supply. Your best bet now is the resale platform, but FIFA has capped resale prices at 110% of face value to prevent scalping.\nQuestion: What do we learn about World Cup tickets from the conversation?",
