            "transcript": "M: I heard that a K-pop group is performing at the World Cup fan festival in New York during the tournament. Is that actually happening?\nW: Yes — FIFA has organized cultural performances at all 16 host cities throughout the tournament. The opening ceremony at Estadio Azteca will feature artists from all three host nations. It's not just about football; it's a global cultural celebration.\nQuestion: What does the woman say about the World Cup cultural events?",
            "translation": "M: 我听说一个韩国流行音乐组合会在世界杯期间，在纽约的球迷节上表演。真有这回事吗？\nW: 是的——国际足联在整个赛事期间，在全部16个主办城市都安排了文化演出。阿兹特克体育场的开幕式将汇集三个主办国的艺术家。这不只是足球，而是一场全球文化庆典。\nQuestion: 女士对世界杯文化活动说了什么？"
