          "transcript": "W: Hello, Professor White, I got my grade in the mail this morning, but I think there might be a mistake in my mark.\nM: Yeah, I've got several calls just like yours. There must be a problem with the computing system. It should be straightened out in a couple of hours.\nQ: What does the man mean?",
