          "transcript": "M: Professor Johnson, last night when I was putting the finishing touches on my paper, a computer failure completely wiped out my files. Do you think I can have another day to retype it?\nW: I'm sorry, Rod. I'm leaving for a conference tomorrow and I'll be away two weeks. I suppose you could send me an E-copy.\nQ: Why does the man say he can't submit his assignment on time?",
          "translation": "男：约翰逊教授，昨晚我正在给论文做最后润色时，电脑故障把我所有的文件都弄丢了。您看能不能再给我一天时间重新打一遍？\n女：对不起，罗德。我明天要去开会，要离开两周。我想你可以给我发一份电子版。\n问：男士为什么说他无法按时提交作业？"
