          "transcript": "W: I thought there was still time for me to apply for a student loan. But someone just told me that the closing date was last Tuesday.\nM: Are you sure? I thought we still had another month. Wait, I've got a brochure right here. Last Tuesday was the opening date.\nQ: What does the man imply?",
