          "transcript": "M: Frankly, when I sit at the back of the classroom, I can't see the words on the board clearly.\nW: Well, you've been wearing those same glasses as long as I've known you. Why not get a new pair? It wouldn't cost you too much.\nQ: What does the woman imply about the man's glasses?",
