          "transcript": "M: The instructions on the package say that you need to do some assembly yourself. I've spent all afternoon trying in vain to put this bookcase together.\nW: I know what you mean. Last time I tried to assemble a toy train for my son and I almost gave up.\nQ: What does the man find difficult?",
