          "transcript": "M: Oh, I'm so sorry I forgot to bring along the book you borrowed from the library.\nW: What a terrible memory you have! Anyway, I won't need it until Friday night. As long as I can get it by then, OK?\nQ: What do we learn from this conversation?",
          "translation": "M: 哦，真抱歉，我忘了把你从图书馆借来的那本书带来。\nW: 你的记性也太差了吧！不过没关系，我到周五晚上才需要用。只要到时候能拿到就行了，好吗？\nQ: 从这段对话中我们能了解到什么？"
