          "answer": "C",
          "explanation": "推理判断题。问题问：男士暗示了什么？根据听力原文 \"spending too much time indoors with all that artificial lighting can do that to you\" (在室内待得太久、长时间处于人造灯光下就会对你造成这种影响)，可知C项正确。",
          "transcript": "W: Doctor, I haven't been able to get enough sleep lately, and I'm too tired to concentrate in class.\nM: Well, you know, spending too much time indoors with all that artificial lighting can do that to you. Your body loses track of whether it's day or night.\nQ: What does the man imply?",
          "translation": "W: 医生，我最近一直睡不好觉，上课时累得没法集中注意力。\nM: 嗯，你知道，在室内待得太久，整天处在那样的灯光下，就会让你变成这样。你的身体分不清白天还是黑夜了。\nQ: 男士暗示了什么？"
