          "transcript": "M: I think I'll get one of those new T-shirts, you know, with the school's logo on both the front and the back.\nW: You'll regret it. They are expensive, and I've heard the printing fades easily when you wash them.\nQ: What does the woman mean?",
          "translation": "M: 我想买一件那种新T恤，你知道的，就是正反面都印着校徽的那种。\nW: 你会后悔的。那些T恤很贵，而且我听说上面的印花一洗就容易褪色。\nQ: 女士的话是什么意思？"
