          "transcript": "M: Would you please tell me where I can get batteries for this brand of camera?\nW: Let me have a look. Oh, yes, go down this aisle, pass the garden tools, you'll find them on the shelf next to the light bulbs.\nQ: What is the man looking for?",
          "translation": "M: 你能告诉我哪里能买到这个牌子相机用的电池吗？\nW: 让我看看。哦，有了，沿着这条过道走下去，经过园艺工具区，你会在灯泡旁边的货架上找到它们。\nQ: 男士在找什么？"
