          "transcript": "W: Good evening and welcome to tonight's edition of Legendary Lives. Our subject this evening is James Dean, actor and hero for the young people of his time. Edward Murray is the author of a new biography of Dean.\nW: Good evening, Edward.\nM: Hello, Marian.\nW: Edward, tell us what you know about Dean's early life.\nM: He was born in Indiana in 1931, but his parents moved to California when he was five. He wasn't there long though because his mother passed away just four years later. Jimmy's father sent him back to Indiana after that to live with his aunt.\nW: So how did he get into acting?\nM: Well, first he acted in plays at high school, then he went to college in California where he got seriously into acting. In 1951 he moved to New York to do more stage work.\nW: Then when did his movie career really start?\nM: 1955. His first starring role was in East of Eden. It was fabulous. Dean became a huge success. But the movie that really made him famous was his second one, Rebel Without a Cause, that was about teenagers who felt like they didn't fit into society.\nW: So how many more movies did he make?\nM: Just one more, then he died in that car crash in California in 1955.\nW: What a tragedy! He only made three movies! So what made him the legend he still is today?\nM: Well I guess his looks, his acting ability, his short life, and maybe the type of character he played in his movies. Many young people saw him as a symbol of American youth.\nQuestions 22 to 25 are based on the conversation you have just heard.\n22.\tWhat is the woman doing?\n23.\tWhy did James Dean move back to Indiana when he was young?\n24.\tWhat does the man say James Dean did at college in California?\n25.\tWhat do we learn about James Dean from the conversation?",
          "translation": "W: 晚上好，欢迎收看今晚的《传奇人生》节目。今晚我们介绍的人物是詹姆斯·迪恩，他是那个时代年轻人的演员和偶像。爱德华·默里是迪恩新传记的作者。\nW: 晚上好，爱德华。\nM: 你好，玛丽安。\nW: 爱德华，给我们讲讲你所了解的迪恩的早年生活吧。\nM: 他1931年出生在印第安纳州，但五岁时父母搬到了加利福尼亚。不过他没在那儿待多久，因为仅仅四年后他母亲就去世了。之后，吉米的父亲把他送回印第安纳州，和姨妈一起生活。\nW: 那他是怎么开始演戏的呢？\nM: 嗯，他先是在高中参演戏剧，然后去了加利福尼亚上大学，在那里真正迷上了表演。1951年他搬到纽约，做更多的舞台工作。\nW: 那他的电影事业是什么时候真正开始的？\nM: 1955年。他的第一个主演角色是在《伊甸园之东》里，那部电影非常出色，迪恩一举成名。但真正让他声名大噪的是他的第二部电影《无因的反叛》，讲的是那些觉得自己无法融入社会的青少年。\nW: 那他后来又拍了多少部电影？\nM: 只又拍了一部，之后他就在1955年加利福尼亚的那场车祸中去世了。\nW: 真是悲剧！他总共只拍了三部电影！那是什么让他至今仍是传奇人物呢？\nM: 嗯，我想是他的外貌、他的演技、他短暂的一生，也许还有他在电影中塑造的角色类型。许多年轻人把他看作美国青年的象征。\n\n第22至25题是根据你刚才听到的对话提出的。\n22. 这位女士在做什么？\n23. 詹姆斯·迪恩小时候为什么搬回印第安纳州？\n24. 男士说詹姆斯·迪恩在加利福尼亚上大学时做了什么？\n25. 从这段对话中我们能了解到关于詹姆斯·迪恩的什么信息？"
