          "answer": "C",
          "explanation": "细节理解题。问题问：根据WCRF，如果英国人保持正常体重，他们能期待什么？根据听力原文 \"The WCRF has estimated that 19,000 cancers a year in Britain could be prevented if people lost their excess weight\" (WCRF估计，如果人们减掉多余的体重，英国每年可预防19000例癌症)，可知许多癌症病例可以避免，C项正确。",
          "transcript": "Enjoying an iced coffee? Better skip dinner or hit the gym afterwards, with a cancer charity warning that some iced coffees contain as many calories as a hot dinner.\n\nThe World Cancer Research Fund (WCRF) conducted a survey of iced coffees sold by some popular chains in Britain including Starbucks, Caffe Nero and Costa Coffee to gauge the calories as studies increasingly link obesity with cancer.\n\nThe worst offender - a coffee from Starbucks -- had 561 calories. Other iced coffees contained more than 450 calories and the majority had an excess of 200.\n\nHealth experts advise that the average woman should consume about 2,000 calories a day and a man about 2,500 calories to maintain a healthy weight. Dieters aim for 1,000 to 1,500 calories a day.\n\n\"The fact that there is an iced coffee on the market with over a quarter of a woman's daily calories allowance is alarming,\" Dr Rachel Thompson, science programme manager at London-based WCRF, said in a widely-reported statement.\n\n\"This is the amount of calories you might expect to have in an evening meal, not in a drink.\" The WCRF has estimated that 19,000 cancers a year in Britain could be prevented if people lost their excess weight with growing evidence that excess body fat increases the risk of various cancers. \"If you are having these types of coffee regularly then they will increase the chances of you becoming overweight, which in turn increases your risk of developing cancer, as well as other diseases such as heart disease,\" she said.",
          "translation": "正在享用冰咖啡吗？那最好省掉晚餐，或者之后去健身，因为一家癌症慈善机构警告说，有些冰咖啡所含的热量抵得上一顿热乎乎的晚餐。\n\n世界癌症研究基金会（WCRF）对英国一些受欢迎的连锁店——包括星巴克、Caffe Nero和Costa咖啡——销售的冰咖啡进行了调查，以衡量其热量，因为越来越多的研究将肥胖与癌症联系起来。\n\n热量最高的“罪魁祸首”是星巴克的一款咖啡，达561卡路里。其他冰咖啡的热量超过450卡路里，大多数都超过200卡路里。\n\n健康专家建议，普通女性每天应摄入约2000卡路里，男性约2500卡路里，以保持健康体重。节食者则每天以1000至1500卡路里为目标。\n\n“市面上有一种冰咖啡，其热量超过女性每日卡路里摄入量的四分之一，这一事实令人担忧，”总部位于伦敦的世界癌症研究基金会的科学项目经理蕾切尔·汤普森博士在一份被广泛报道的声明中说。\n\n“这本来应该是一顿晚餐所含的热量，而不应该出现在一杯饮料里。”世界癌症研究基金会估计，如果人们减掉多余的体重，英国每年可以预防1.9万例癌症，因为越来越多的证据表明，体内多余的脂肪会增加患各种癌症的风险。“如果你经常喝这类咖啡，它们就会增加你超重的几率，进而增加你患癌症以及心脏病等其他疾病的风险，”她说。"
