          "answer": "B",
          "explanation": "细节理解题。问题问：Florence Hayes作为记者的主要职责是什么？根据听力原文 \"Specifically she covers crime in the Green Ville area\" (具体来说，她负责报道Greenville地区的犯罪新闻)，可知B项正确。",
          "transcript": "Florence Hayes is a journalist for the Green Ville Journal, the daily newspaper in town. Specifically she covers crime in the Green Ville area. This responsibility takes her to many different places every week — the police station, the court and the hospital. Most of the crimes that she writes about fall into two groups: violent crimes and crimes against property. There isn't much violent crime in a small town like Green Ville, or at least not as much as in the large urban areas. But assaults often occur on Friday and Saturday nights, near the bars downtown. There are also one or two rapes on campus every semester. Florence is very interested in this type of crime and tries to write a long article about each one. She expects that this will make women more careful when they walk around Green Ville alone at night.\n\nFortunately, there are usually no murders in Green Ville. Crimes against property make up most of Miss Hayes' reporting. They range from minor cases of deliberate damaging of things to much more serious offenses, such as car accidents involving drunk drivers or bank robberies. But Florence has to report all of these violations from the thief who took typewriters from every unlocked room in the dormitory to the thief who stole one million dollars worth of art work from the university museum. Miss Hayes enjoys working for a newspaper but she sometimes gets unhappy about all the crime she has to report. She would prefer to start writing about something more interesting and less unpleasant such as local news or politics, maybe next year.",
          "translation": "弗洛伦斯·海斯是镇上日报《格林维尔日报》的一名记者。具体来说，她负责报道格林维尔地区的犯罪新闻。这份职责每周都让她去到许多不同的地方——警察局、法院和医院。她所写的犯罪大多分为两类：暴力犯罪和侵犯财产罪。在格林维尔这样的小镇上，暴力犯罪并不多，至少没有大城市那么多。但袭击事件经常发生在周五和周六晚上、市中心酒吧附近。每个学期校园里也会发生一两起强奸案。弗洛伦斯对这类犯罪非常感兴趣，并尽量就每一起都写一篇长文。她希望这样能让女性夜晚独自在格林维尔行走时更加小心。\n\n所幸，格林维尔通常没有谋杀案。侵犯财产罪占海斯小姐报道的大部分。这些案件从故意损坏物品的轻微案件，到更严重的罪行——比如涉及醉酒司机的车祸或银行抢劫——不一而足。但弗洛伦斯必须报道所有这些违法行为，从从宿舍每间没上锁的房间里偷走打字机的小偷，到从大学博物馆偷走价值100万美元艺术品的大盗。海斯小姐喜欢为报社工作，但有时也会对自己不得不报道的所有这些犯罪感到不快。她更想开始写一些更有趣、不那么令人不快的内容，比如本地新闻或政治，也许明年吧。"
