          "transcript": "M: A famous Russian ballet is coming to town next weekend. But I can't find a ticket anywhere.\nW: Don't be upset. My sister just happened to have one and she can't go since she has got some sort of conflict in her schedule.\nQ: What does the woman mean?",
          "translation": "M: 下周末有一个著名的俄罗斯芭蕾舞团要来城里演出，但我到处都买不到票。\nW: 别难过。我姐姐恰好有一张票，而她又去不了，因为她的日程安排有冲突。\nQ: 这位女士的话是什么意思？"
