          "transcript": "W: We're taking up a collection to buy a gift for Gemma. She'll have been with the company 25 years next week.\nM: Well, count me in. But I'm a bit short on cash now. When do you need it?\nQ: What is the man going to do?",
          "translation": "W: 我们正在凑钱给杰玛买礼物。下周她就为公司工作满25年了。\nM: 那算我一个。但我现在手头有点紧。你什么时候要钱？\nQ: 这位男士打算做什么？"
