          "explanation": "主旨大意题。问题问：说话者在谈论什么？根据听力原文 \"Just look at this newspaper, nothing but robberies, suicide and murder... many papers lack interest in reporting something positive\" (看看这份报纸，全是抢劫、自杀和谋杀……许多报纸对报道积极的内容缺乏兴趣)，可知D项正确。",
          "transcript": "M: Just look at this newspaper, nothing but robberies, suicide and murder. Do you still believe people are basically good?\nW: Of course. But many papers lack interest in reporting something positive like peace, love and generosity.\nQ: What are the speakers talking about?",
          "translation": "M: 看看这份报纸，除了抢劫、自杀和谋杀什么都没有。你还相信人性本善吗？\nW: 当然相信。只是很多报纸对报道和平、爱和慷慨这类积极正面的内容缺乏兴趣。\nQ: 说话者在谈论什么？"
