          "transcript": "M: I can't believe so many people want to sign up for the Korea Development Conference. We will have to limit the number of participants.\nW: Yeah, otherwise we won't have room for the equipment.\nQ: What are the speakers going to do?",
          "translation": "M: 真不敢相信有这么多人想报名参加韩国发展会议。我们得限制参会人数了。\nW: 是啊，不然就没地方放设备了。\nQ: 说话者打算做什么？"
