          "explanation": "推理判断题。问题问：女士的话是什么意思？根据听力原文 \"No problem. You can count on me to get one for you. My family has tons of camping gear.\" (没问题，你可以指望我给你弄一个，我家有大量的露营装备)，可知C项正确。",
          "transcript": "M: I'd like to go camping with you this weekend, but I don't have a sleeping bag.\nW: No problem. You can count on me to get one for you. My family has tons of camping gear.\nQ: What does the woman mean?",
