          "transcript": "W: Three letters of recommendation are required to apply to graduate schools. I was wondering if the one Professor Smith wrote for me last year could still be used.\nM: It's a bit dated. You'd better submit a recent one.\nQ: What does the man suggest the woman do?",
          "translation": "W: 申请研究生院需要三封推荐信。我在想史密斯教授去年给我写的那封还能不能用。\nM: 那封有点过时了。你最好提交一封近期的推荐信。\nQ: 这位男士建议女士做什么？"
