          "answer": "A",
          "explanation": "推理判断题。问题问：关于男士我们能推断出什么？根据听力原文 \"Oh, thanks for the invitation, but this is how I relax. I'd rather not make it something formal and structured.\" (谢谢你的邀请，但这就是我放松的方式，我宁愿不把它变成正式而有条理的事情)，可知A项正确。",
          "transcript": "W: I've noticed that you spend a lot of time tending your garden. Would you like to join our gardening club? We meet every other Wednesday.\nM: Oh, thanks for the invitation, but this is how I relax. I'd rather not make it something formal and structured.\nQ: What can we infer about the man?",
