          "transcript": "M: Janet, here's the book I borrowed from you, but I'm so sorry that I can't find its jacket.\nW: It doesn't matter. Anyway, you are one of the few people who actually return books to me.\nQ: What does the woman imply?",
          "translation": "M: 珍妮特，这是我从你那儿借的书，但很抱歉，我找不到书的护封了。\nW: 没关系。不管怎么说，你是少数真正把书还给我的人之一。\nQ: 这位女士暗示了什么？"
