          "explanation": "推理判断题。问题问：女士的话是什么意思？根据听力原文 \"I drove around the parking lot for nearly an hour, looking for a space before I finally gave up and came home\" (我开车在停车场绕了近一个小时找车位，最后放弃回家了)，可知D项正确。",
          "transcript": "M: Lisa, have you been to the new supermarket yet?\nW: Yes and no. I went there last Saturday for their grand opening sale, but I drove around the parking lot for nearly an hour, looking for a space before I finally gave up and came home.\nQ: What does the woman mean?",
          "translation": "M: 莉萨，你去过那家新超市了吗？\nW: 算是去了，也算没去。上周六我去参加他们的开业大促销，但我在停车场开车转了将近一个小时找车位，最后放弃回家了。\nQ: 这位女士的话是什么意思？"
