          "answer": "C",
          "explanation": "推理判断题。问题问：男士的话是什么意思？根据听力原文 \"I'm up to my neck in work. I've got to finish this report. I don't want to miss the deadline\" (我忙得不可开交，必须完成这份报告，不想错过最后期限)，可知C项正确。",
          "transcript": "W: You've been sitting at the computer for hours. Let's take a coffee break, shall we?\nM: I wish I could. You know, I'm up to my neck in work. I've got to finish this report. I don't want to miss the deadline.\nQ: What does the man mean?",
          "translation": "W: 你在电脑前坐了好几个小时了。我们休息一下喝杯咖啡吧，好吗？\nM: 但愿我能。你知道，我忙得不可开交。我必须完成这份报告，我不想错过最后期限。\nQ: 这位男士的话是什么意思？"
