          "explanation": "细节理解题。问题问：男士说了玛莎的什么情况？根据听力原文 \"She is just not performing. We may have to let her go\" (她就是表现不佳，我们可能不得不让她走人)，可知玛莎可能因表现差而被解雇，B项正确。",
          "transcript": "W: What is it, Bob? You sounded pretty serious on the phone. Have we still got a budget problem?\nM: I don't know. I hope not. The meeting's on Friday. But that's not what I want to talk to you about. Er... Close the door, will you? It's Marsha.\nW: Marsha? What about her?\nM: I am worried. I don't know what to do. She is just not performing. We may have to let her go.\nW: Fire her? She's been with us for a long time, Bob. If she leaves, it will be a big loss to us. She's done really excellent work.\nM: Yes, but lately, the last month or so in fact, there have been a lot of problems. She's changed. Not only does she have a tendency to be moody all the time, but she misses appointments, doesn't follow through on projects and doesn't seem to plan anything till the last minute.\nW: Em... Did she ever explain why she didn't show up for the Denver trip?\nM: No, she said she was sorry and that wouldn't happen again. Something about her mixed up on the arrangement to get to the airport. Now whenever anybody mentions the subject to her, she just goes silent. I don't know. Thank goodness, David pulled her out as a whole on that one.\nW: Yes, he did a really fine job, filling in for Marsha like that at the last minute.\nM: I don't think it was the first time he has to do that. If we knew all the facts, I think we'd find that he has been covering for Marsha on quite a few projects.\nQuestions 9 to 12 are based on the conversation you have just heard.\n9.\tWhy did the man call the woman?\n10.\tWhat does the man say about Marsha?\n11.\tWhat does the man say about Marsha's Denver trip?\n12.\tWhat does the man say about David?",
          "translation": "W: 怎么了，鲍勃？你在电话里听起来很严肃。我们还有预算问题吗？\nM: 我不知道。希望没有。会议在周五开。但这不是我想和你谈的事。呃……把门关上好吗？是玛莎的事。\nW: 玛莎？她怎么了？\nM: 我很担心。我不知道该怎么办。她就是不干活了。我们可能得让她走人了。\nW: 解雇她？她跟我们共事很久了，鲍勃。如果她走了，对我们来说会是一大损失。她一直干得很出色。\nM: 是的，但最近，事实上是最近一个月左右，出了很多问题。她变了。她不仅总是动不动就闹情绪，还错过约会，不把项目做到底，而且似乎什么事都要拖到最后一刻才计划。\nW: 嗯……她有没有解释过为什么没去丹佛的那次行程？\nM: 没有，她只是说她很抱歉，以后不会再发生这种事。说什么她在去机场的安排上搞混了。现在只要有人跟她提起这件事，她就沉默不语。我不知道。谢天谢地，那次大卫把她从困境中解救了出来。\nW: 是啊，大卫干得真不错，在最后一刻那样顶替玛莎。\nM: 我觉得这已经不是他第一次不得不这么做了。如果我们了解全部事实，我想我们会发现他在不少项目上一直在替玛莎遮掩。\nQuestions 9 to 12 are based on the conversation you have just heard.\n9.\t男士为什么给女士打电话？\n10.\t关于玛莎，男士说了什么？\n11.\t关于玛莎的丹佛之行，男士说了什么？\n12.\t关于大卫，男士说了什么？"
