          "transcript": "W: Well, before we decide we're going to live in Enderby, we really ought to have a look at the schools. We want the children to have a good secondary education, so we'd better see what's available.\nM: They gave me some information at the district office and I took notes. It appears there are five secondary schools in Enderby, three state schools and two private.\nW: I don't know if we want private schools, do we?\nM: I don't think so, but we'll look at them anyway. There are Saint Mary's, that's a Catholic school for girls and Carlton Abbey, that's a very old boys' boarding school, founded in 1672.\nW: Are all the state schools coeducational?\nM: Yes, it seems so.\nW: I think little Keith is very good with his hands. We ought to send him to a school with good vocational training — carpentry, electronics, that sort of thing.\nM: In that case, we are best off at Enderby Comprehensive. I gather they have excellent workshops and instructors. But it says here the Donwell also has good facilities. Enderby High has a little, but they are mostly academic. No vocational training at all at Carlton Abbey or Saint Mary's.\nW: What are the schools like academically? How many children go on to university every year?\nM: Well, Enderby High is very good. And Carlton Abbey even better, 70% of their pupils go on to university. Donwell isn't so good. Only 8%. And Enderby Comprehensive and Saint Mary's not much more, about 10%.\nW: Well, it seems like there is a broad selection of schools. But we'll have to find out more than statistics before we can decide.\n12. What do the speakers want their children to have?\n13. What do the speakers say about little Keith?\n14. What school has the highest percentage of pupils who go on to university?\n15. What are the speakers going to do next?",
          "translation": "W: 嗯，在我们决定要住在恩德比之前，我们真应该先看看那儿的学校。我们想让孩子接受良好的中学教育，所以最好看看有哪些学校可选。\nM: 区办事处给了我一些资料，我做了笔记。看来恩德比有五所中学，三所公立，两所私立。\nW: 我不知道我们是否想上私立学校，是吧？\nM: 我觉得不想，但我们还是看看吧。有圣玛丽学校，那是一所天主教女子学校；还有卡尔顿修道院学校，那是一所非常古老的男子寄宿学校，建于1672年。\nW: 所有公立学校都是男女同校吗？\nM: 是的，似乎如此。\nW: 我觉得小基思动手能力很强。我们应该送他去一所职业培训好的学校——木工、电子之类的。\nM: 那样的话，我们最好选恩德比综合中学。我了解到他们有很好的工作车间和教师。但资料上说唐韦尔中学的设施也很好。恩德比高中有一些，但主要是学术型的。卡尔顿修道院学校和圣玛丽学校完全没有职业培训。\nW: 这些学校的学业水平怎么样？每年有多少孩子升入大学？\nM: 嗯，恩德比高中很好。卡尔顿修道院学校更好，他们70%的学生升入大学。唐韦尔中学没那么好，只有8%。恩德比综合中学和圣玛丽学校也多不了多少，大约10%。\nW: 嗯，看来学校的选择面很广。但在做决定之前，我们还得多了解一些情况，而不只是这些统计数据。\n\n12. 说话者希望他们的孩子接受什么？\n13. 关于小基思，说话者说了什么？\n14. 哪所学校升入大学的学生比例最高？\n15. 说话者接下来打算做什么？"
