          "answer": "A",
          "explanation": "推理判断题。问题问：男士暗示玛丽什么？根据听力原文 \"it's quite old and in very poor condition. Frankly speaking, that she got it working amazes me a lot.\" (它又旧又破。坦白说，她居然把它修好了，这让我很惊讶)，可知玛丽擅长修理东西，A项正确。",
          "transcript": "W: Yesterday I was surprised to see Mary using that washing machine you were going to throw away.\nM: Yes, it's quite old and in very poor condition. Frankly speaking, that she got it working amazes me a lot.\nQ: What does the man imply about Mary?",
          "translation": "W: 昨天我看到玛丽在用那台你打算扔掉的洗衣机，我很惊讶。\nM: 是的，那台洗衣机又旧又破。坦白说，她居然把它修好了，这让我很惊讶。\nQ: 男士暗示玛丽什么？"
