          "answer": "C",
          "explanation": "事实细节题。问题问：女士要对格兰特先生负责什么？根据听力原文 \"You'd be responsible to me for all advertising and to Mr. Grunt for public relations.\" (你对我负责所有广告事务，对格兰特先生负责公共关系)，可知她要向格兰特先生负责公共关系，C项正确。",
          "transcript": "M: Ah, how do you do, Miss Wenzmore?\nW: How do you do?\nM: Do sit down.\nW: Thank you.\nM: I'm glad you're interested in our job. Now, let me explain it. We plan to increase our advertising considerably. At present, an advertising agency handles our account, but we haven't been too pleased with the results lately and we may give our account to another agency.\nW: What would my work entail?\nM: You'd be responsible to me for all advertising and to Mr. Grunt for public relations. You'd brief the agency whoever it is on the kind of advertising campaign we want. You would also be responsible for getting our leaflets, brochures and catalogs designed.\nW: I presume you advertise in the national press as well as the trade press.\nM: Yes, we do.\nW: Have you thought about advertising on television?\nM: We don't think it's a suitable medium for us. And it's much too expensive.\nW: I can just imagine a scene with a typist sitting on an old-fashioned typing chair, her back aching, exhausted, then we show her in one of your chairs, her back properly supported, feeling full of energy, typing twice as quickly.\nM: Before you get carried away with your little scene, Miss Wenzmore, I regret to have to tell you again that we are not planning to go into television.\nW: That's a shame. I've been doing a lot of television work lately and it interests me enormously.\nM: Then I really don't think that this is quite the right job for you here, Miss Wenzmore.\n12. What does the man think of their present advertising agency?\n13. What would the woman be responsible for to Mr. Grunt?\n14. What is the woman most interested in doing?\n15. What does the man think of the woman applicant?",
          "translation": "M: 啊，你好，温兹莫小姐？\nW: 你好。\nM: 请坐。\nW: 谢谢。\nM: 我很高兴你对我们的职位感兴趣。现在让我来介绍一下。我们计划大幅增加广告投放。目前，一家广告代理公司负责我们的业务，但我们对近来的结果不太满意，可能会把业务交给另一家代理公司。\nW: 我的工作会包括哪些内容？\nM: 你将就所有广告事务向我汇报，并就公共关系事务向格伦特先生汇报。无论代理公司是哪一家，你都要向他们简要说明我们想要的广告宣传活动类型。你还要负责安排我们的传单、小册子和产品目录的设计。\nW: 我猜想你们既在行业报刊上，也在全国性报刊上登广告。\nM: 是的，我们是这样做的。\nW: 你们考虑过在电视上做广告吗？\nM: 我们认为电视对我们来说不是合适的媒介，而且也太贵了。\nW: 我可以想象这样一个画面：一位打字员坐在一把老式的打字椅上，背痛、疲惫不堪，然后我们让她坐在你们的椅子上，她的背部得到恰当的支撑，精力充沛，打字速度快了一倍。\nM: 温兹莫小姐，在你沉浸于自己的小画面之前，我很遗憾必须再次告诉你，我们不打算涉足电视广告。\nW: 那太可惜了。我最近做了很多电视方面的工作，而且我对此非常感兴趣。\nM: 那么我真的认为，这份工作对您来说不太合适，温兹莫小姐。\n\n12. 男士对他们目前的广告代理公司怎么看？\n13. 女士将对格伦特先生负责什么？\n14. 女士最感兴趣做什么？\n15. 男士认为这位求职者怎么样？"
