          "answer": "B",
          "explanation": "推理判断题。问题问：关于男士的日常生活我们了解到什么？根据听力原文 \"I'm just getting ready to go home. Susan is expecting me for dinner. I wanted to be on time for a change.\" (我正准备回家，Susan 等我回去吃晚饭，我想这次能准时一点)，可知B项正确。",
          "transcript": "M: Hello, Jane.\nW: Hello, Paul.\nM: Please come in. I'm just getting ready to go home. Susan is expecting me for dinner. I wanted to be on time for a change.\nW: Look, I'm terribly sorry to drop in at this time on Friday, Paul, but it is rather important.\nM: That's OK. What's the problem?\nW: Well, Paul, I won't keep you long. You see there is a problem with the exchange rates. The Indian Rupee has taken a fall on the foreign exchange market. You see there has been a sharp increase in India's balance of payment deficit.\nM: I see. That's serious, isn't it?\nW: Well, as you know, there have been reports of unrest in India, and the prospects for the Rupee look pretty gloomy.\nM: And that's going to affect us, as if we didn't have enough problems on our hands.\nW: So I thought it would be wise to take out forward exchange cover to protect our position on the outstanding contracts.\nM: Just a minute. Forward exchange cover? Now what does that mean exactly?\nW: Well, it means that JO Motors enters into a commitment to sell Indian Rupees at the present rate.\nM: I see. And how will that benefit us?\nW: Well, JO Motors won't lose out if the Indian Rupee falls further.\nM: What will it cost, Jane?\nW: A small percentage, about 1%, and that can be built into the price of the bike.\nM: Well, I don't suppose there is much choice. All right, Jane, let's put it into action.\n9. What do we learn about the man's daily life?\n10. Why did the woman come to see the man?\n11. What makes the woman worry about the Indian Rupee?",
          "translation": "M: 你好，简。\nW: 你好，保罗。\nM: 请进。我正准备回家。苏珊在等我吃晚饭。我想这次准时一点。\nW: 听我说，保罗，非常抱歉在周五这个时候突然来找你，但这事相当重要。\nM: 没关系。是什么问题？\nW: 嗯，保罗，我不会耽误你太久。你看，汇率出了问题。印度卢比在外汇市场上已经下跌了。你看，印度的国际收支逆差急剧增加。\nM: 我明白了。这很严重，不是吗？\nW: 嗯，如你所知，一直有关于印度局势动荡的报道，卢比的前景看起来相当黯淡。\nM: 而那会影响我们，就好像我们手头的麻烦还不够多似的。\nW: 所以我想，办理远期外汇保值来保护我们在未完成合同上的头寸是明智的。\nM: 等一下。远期外汇保值？那究竟是什么意思？\nW: 嗯，意思是JO汽车公司承诺按当前汇率卖出印度卢比。\nM: 我明白了。那对我们有什么好处？\nW: 嗯，如果印度卢比进一步下跌，JO汽车公司就不会遭受损失。\nM: 这要花多少钱，简？\nW: 很小的一个比例，大约1%，而且可以计入自行车的价格。\nM: 嗯，我想我们没有太多选择。好吧，简，我们就着手去办吧。\n\n9. 关于男士的日常生活，我们了解到什么？\n10. 女士为什么来见男士？\n11. 什么让女士担心印度卢比？"
